# Contributing to <% .Name %>

Thanks for taking the time to contribute!

## Workflow

1. Fork the repository and create a topic branch from `main`.
2. Make your change, with tests where it makes sense.
<% if .HasMakefile -%>
3. Run `make check` (format, lint, test) and make sure it passes.
<% else -%>
3. Make sure the project's checks pass.
<% end -%>
4. Open a pull request describing *what* changed and *why*.

## Commit messages

Use short, imperative subject lines (`Add retry to client`, not `Added retries`).
Reference issues in the body where relevant. We recommend
[Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) so the changelog is easy to maintain.

## Reporting bugs

Open an issue using the bug report template and include steps to reproduce.
